Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H0_0::
	.string "The TRICK MASTER always vanishes\n"
	.string "like smoke. How does he do it?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H0_1::
	.string "Aiyeeeh! You're much too strong!\n"
	.string "How do you do it?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H0_2::
	.string "I wish I could appear and disappear\n"
	.string "as if I were smoke, too.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H1_0::
	.string "Whoever wins will get through here\n"
	.string "first. That's the feeling I get.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H1_1::
	.string "Oh!\n"
	.string "Well, go ahead, then!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H1_2::
	.string "You're solving all the puzzles in the\n"
	.string "TRICK HOUSE. That's the feeling I\l"
	.string "get.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H2_0::
	.string "Going around the same spot…\n"
	.string "It begets ill fortune…$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H2_1::
	.string "Defeated!\n"
	.string "It's a bad sign…$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H2_2::
	.string "I've circled the same spot over ten\n"
	.string "times now… It's ill fortune…$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H3_0::
	.string "I ever so closely watched you\n"
	.string "coming!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H3_1::
	.string "This outcome I didn't see coming…$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H3_2::
	.string "Well, anyway, we both picked a weird\n"
	.string "place to get acquainted.\p"
	.string "As one weirdo to another,\n"
	.string "let's do our best!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H4_0::
	.string "Nufufufu, here at last!\n"
	.string "Let's get right with it!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H4_1::
	.string "You're so casual about winning!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H4_2::
	.string "Humph! I'm not upset!\n"
	.string "Not me!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H5_0::
	.string "It's awfully cramped in here…$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H5_1::
	.string "Oh, yes, strong you are.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_H5_2::
	.string "I was hoping to switch places with\n"
	.string "you when I beat you, but…$"

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlexisIntro::
    .string "The arrows turn when you step on\n"
    .string "them. So do the dolls.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlexisDefeat::
    .string "Round and round we went.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlexisPostBattle::
    .string "Five switches. Press them all and\n"
    .string "the floor forgets its pattern.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlvaroIntro::
    .string "I've been going in circles since\n"
    .string "breakfast and I'm not joking.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlvaroDefeat::
    .string "Straight line, that one.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_AlvaroPostBattle::
    .string "Follow an arrow that's already\n"
    .string "pointing where you want to go.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_EverettIntro::
    .string "Don't watch the dolls. Watch what\n"
    .string "the dolls are standing on.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_EverettDefeat::
    .string "Should have watched you.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_EverettPostBattle::
    .string "The switches stay pressed. That's\n"
    .string "the only mercy in this room.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_JoshuaIntro::
    .string "Six trainers in this one. He\n"
    .string "thinks it's his best work.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_JoshuaDefeat::
    .string "It might be his best work.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_JoshuaPostBattle::
    .string "When every switch is down, the\n"
    .string "last arrow points at the scroll.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_MarielaIntro::
    .string "Turn, step, turn, step. You get\n"
    .string "used to it and then you don't.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_MarielaDefeat::
    .string "I was mid-turn. That's my excuse.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_MarielaPostBattle::
    .string "He tested this room on himself and\n"
    .string "got stuck for a day.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_PatriciaIntro::
    .string "Last one before the scroll. I've\n"
    .string "been told to be difficult.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_PatriciaDefeat::
    .string "I was told, not asked.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_PatriciaPostBattle::
    .string "Go on. He'll be waiting at the far\n"
    .string "door doing his voice.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle7_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened::
    .string "{PLAYER} wrote the secret word on\n"
    .string "the door.\p"
    .string "The lock turned itself over and\n"
    .string "the door swung wide.$"
@ END PATCH
